// ── Key OTel concepts ───────────────────────────────────────────
// Trace    — the complete request journey across services
// Span     — one unit of work (HTTP call, DB query, function)
// Context  — carries trace/span IDs across async boundaries
// Exporter — sends spans to a backend (Jaeger, Tempo, Datadog)
// Collector— OTel daemon that receives, processes, and routes telemetry

